  "title": "wslua: Fix use-after-free of DissectorTable name",
  "description": "There is a use-after-free of `name` and `ui_name` when these strings are passed from `DissectorTable_new()` into `register_dissector_table()`, which stores the pointers longer than the lifetime of the allocation.\n\nIntroduced in 13795914a13fc559800aa123f29171b8d700e22d.\n\nFixes #20418.",
